  "notes": "顶栏标题与 ⋯ 菜单改用系统导航栏（scene.menu + menu.invoke）；图标改画真 SF Symbol；播放器钉在页底、走带键常驻；切 Tab 退出子页栈",
  "localizedNotes": {
    "en": "Title and ... menu now use the system navigation bar (scene.menu + menu.invoke); icons render real SF Symbols; the player is pinned to the page bottom with always-visible transport; switching tabs pops the subpage stack"
  },
  "manifest": {
